    "Load error": "Bet\u00f6lt\u00e9si hiba",
    "Open Instagram": "Nyissa meg az Instagramot",
    "Show error": "Hiba megjelen\u00edt\u00e9se",
    "SYSTEM UNDER MAINTENANCE": "RENDSZER KARBANTART\u00c1S ALATT",
    "user": "felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3",
    "\u201cWhistling\u201d mice are essentially singing to each other, but at frequencies too high for humans to hear.": "A \u201ef\u00fcty\u00fcl\u0151\u201d egerek l\u00e9nyeg\u00e9ben \u00e9nekelnek egym\u00e1snak, de t\u00fal magas frekvenci\u00e1n ahhoz, hogy az emberek meghallj\u00e1k.",
    "A blue whale\u2019s heart is so large that a human could swim through its main arteries.": "Egy k\u00e9k b\u00e1lna sz\u00edve akkora, hogy az ember \u00e1t tud \u00faszni a f\u0151 art\u00e9ri\u00e1kon.",
    "A new update is available. Please check the store.": "\u00daj friss\u00edt\u00e9s \u00e9rhet\u0151 el. K\u00e9rj\u00fck, ellen\u0151rizze az \u00fczletet.",
    "A snail can sleep for up to three years without waking up\u2014honestly, relatable.": "Egy csiga ak\u00e1r h\u00e1rom \u00e9vig is aludhat an\u00e9lk\u00fcl, hogy fel\u00e9bredne \u2013 \u0151szint\u00e9n sz\u00f3lva.",
    "Access is restricted for this account.": "A hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9s korl\u00e1tozott ehhez a fi\u00f3khoz.",
    "Ad could not be shown. Please try again.": "A hirdet\u00e9s nem jelen\u00edthet\u0151 meg. K\u00e9rj\u00fck, pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra.",
    "Ad could not be shown. Results cannot be displayed.": "A hirdet\u00e9s nem jelen\u00edthet\u0151 meg. Az eredm\u00e9nyek nem jelen\u00edthet\u0151k meg.",
    "An ant can lift up to 50 times its own weight\u2014if you were an ant, you could lift a car by yourself.": "Egy hangya saj\u00e1t s\u00faly\u00e1nak 50-szeres\u00e9t is k\u00e9pes megemelni \u2013 ha hangya lenn\u00e9l, egyed\u00fcl is felemelhetn\u00e9l egy aut\u00f3t.",
    "An average cloud can weigh around 500,000 kg\u2014like a massive herd of elephants floating overhead.": "Egy \u00e1tlagos felh\u0151 k\u00f6r\u00fclbel\u00fcl 500 000 kg-ot nyomhat \u2013 ak\u00e1r egy hatalmas elef\u00e1ntcsorda, amely a fej\u00fcnk felett lebeg.",
    "An ostrich\u2019s eyes are bigger than its brain\u2014living on the fine line between looking and thinking.": "A strucc szeme nagyobb, mint az agya \u2013 a l\u00e1t\u00e1s \u00e9s a gondolkod\u00e1s k\u00f6z\u00f6tti finom hat\u00e1rvonalon \u00e9l.",
    "An unexpected error occurred.": "V\u00e1ratlan hiba t\u00f6rt\u00e9nt.",
    "Analysis Time!": "Elemz\u00e9s ideje!",
    "Ants don\u2019t have lungs\u2014and they never truly \u201csleep\u201d; they operate nonstop like tiny workaholics.": "A hangy\u00e1knak nincs t\u00fcdej\u00fck \u2013 \u00e9s soha nem \u201ealszanak\u201d igaz\u00e1n; meg\u00e1ll\u00e1s n\u00e9lk\u00fcl m\u0171k\u00f6dnek, mint az apr\u00f3 munkam\u00e1ni\u00e1sok.",
    "Auth Probe": "Auth Probe",
    "Bananas are botanically berries, but strawberries aren\u2019t\u2014botany can be weird.": "A ban\u00e1n botanikailag bogy\u00f3, de az eper nem \u2013 a botanika furcsa lehet.",
    "Butterflies taste with their feet\u2014when they land on a leaf, they\u2019re basically sampling dinner.": "A pillang\u00f3k a l\u00e1bukkal \u00edzlelnek \u2013 amikor egy lev\u00e9lre sz\u00e1llnak, alapvet\u0151en vacsor\u00e1t k\u00f3stolnak.",
    "Cashews grow outside the cashew apple, hanging at the very end\u2014an oddly surprising design.": "A kesudi\u00f3 a kesudi\u00f3 alm\u00e1n k\u00edv\u00fcl n\u0151, a legv\u00e9g\u00e9n l\u00f3g \u2013 ez egy furcs\u00e1n meglep\u0151 design.",
    "Cats spend about 70% of their lives asleep\u2014so a 10-year-old cat has been awake for only about 3 years.": "A macsk\u00e1k \u00e9let\u00fck 70%-\u00e1t alv\u00e1ssal t\u00f6ltik \u2013 teh\u00e1t egy 10 \u00e9ves macska csak k\u00f6r\u00fclbel\u00fcl 3 \u00e9ve van \u00e9bren.",
    "Clear Firebase logs": "Firebase napl\u00f3k t\u00f6rl\u00e9se",
    "Clear store logs": "\u00dczleti napl\u00f3k t\u00f6rl\u00e9se",
    "Close": "Bez\u00e1r\u00e1s",
    "Connection error. Please try again.": "Kapcsol\u00f3d\u00e1si hiba. K\u00e9rj\u00fck, pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra.",
    "Consent update failed. Please try again.": "A hozz\u00e1j\u00e1rul\u00e1s friss\u00edt\u00e9se sikertelen. K\u00e9rj\u00fck, pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra.",
    "COPY": "M\u00c1SOL\u00c1S",
    "Copy all": "Minden m\u00e1sol\u00e1sa",
    "Could not open the link.": "Nem siker\u00fclt megnyitni a hivatkoz\u00e1st.",
    "Cows have \u201cbest friends,\u201d and they can get seriously stressed\u2014and even cry\u2014when separated.": "A teheneknek \u201elegjobb bar\u00e1tai\u201d vannak, \u00e9s komolyan stresszesek lehetnek \u2013 s\u0151t s\u00edrhatnak is \u2013, ha elszakadnak egym\u00e1st\u00f3l.",
    "CRITICAL DIAGNOSTIC ERROR": "KRITIKUS DIAGNOSZTIKAI HIBA",
    "Crows don\u2019t just recognize human faces; they can remember people who treated them badly for years\u2014and even warn other crows.": "A varjak nem csak az emberi arcokat ismerik fel; eml\u00e9kezhetnek azokra az emberekre, akik \u00e9vekig rosszul b\u00e1ntak vel\u00fck \u2013 \u00e9s m\u00e9g figyelmeztethetnek is m\u00e1s varjakat.",
    "DID YOU KNOW?": "TUDTA?",
