    "Firestore test write successful.": "Firestore teszt\u00edr\u00e1s sikeres.",
    "Flamingos are born gray; their famous pink comes from pigments in shrimp and algae they eat.": "A flaming\u00f3k sz\u00fcrk\u00e9nek sz\u00fcletnek; h\u00edres r\u00f3zsasz\u00edn\u00fck az \u00e1ltaluk fogyasztott garn\u00e9lar\u00e1k \u00e9s alg\u00e1k pigmentjeib\u0151l sz\u00e1rmazik.",
    "Follower data was incomplete.": "A k\u00f6vet\u0151i adatok hi\u00e1nyosak voltak.",
    "Following data was incomplete.": "A k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 adatok hi\u00e1nyosak voltak.\nA ",
    "GPS is free to use worldwide, but the U.S. government reportedly spends around \\\$2 million a day to keep it running.": "GPS vil\u00e1gszerte ingyenesen haszn\u00e1lhat\u00f3, de az Egyes\u00fclt \u00c1llamok korm\u00e1nya \u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3lag napi 2 milli\u00f3 doll\u00e1rt k\u00f6lt a m\u0171k\u00f6d\u00e9s fenntart\u00e1s\u00e1ra.",
    "Hippo \u201csweat\u201d can look pink and acts like both sunscreen and an antibacterial shield.": "A v\u00edzil\u00f3 \u201everejt\u00e9ke\u201d r\u00f3zsasz\u00ednnek t\u0171nhet, \u00e9s f\u00e9nyv\u00e9d\u0151k\u00e9nt \u00e9s antibakteri\u00e1lis pajzsk\u00e9nt is m\u0171k\u00f6dik.",
    "Honey never spoils; archaeologists have found 3,000-year-old jars of honey in Egyptian pyramids that were still edible.": "A m\u00e9z soha nem romlik el; a r\u00e9g\u00e9szek 3000 \u00e9ves m\u00e9zesed\u00e9nyeket tal\u00e1ltak egyiptomi piramisokban, amelyek m\u00e9g ehet\u0151ek voltak.",
    "Honeybees can recognize human faces and remember them individually.": "A m\u00e9hek felismerik az emberi arcokat, \u00e9s k\u00fcl\u00f6n-k\u00fcl\u00f6n eml\u00e9keznek r\u00e1juk.",
    "Human DNA is about 50% similar to banana DNA\u2014so calling a banana \u201cmy sibling\u201d tomorrow morning isn\u2019t totally unfair.": "Az emberi DNS k\u00f6r\u00fclbel\u00fcl 50%-ban hasonl\u00f3 a ban\u00e1n DNS-\u00e9hez \u2013 teh\u00e1t nem teljesen igazs\u00e1gtalan egy ban\u00e1nt holnap reggel \u201etestv\u00e9remnek\u201d nevezni.",
    "Instagram message:\\n\$cleanIg": "Instagram-\u00fczenet:\\n\$cleanIg",
    "Instagram requires a security verification (suspicious login / account lock). Verify in the Instagram app and try again.": "Instagram biztons\u00e1gi ellen\u0151rz\u00e9st ig\u00e9nyel (gyan\u00fas bejelentkez\u00e9s / fi\u00f3kz\u00e1r). Ellen\u0151rizze az Instagram alkalmaz\u00e1sban, \u00e9s pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra.",
    "Instagram requires a security verification for your account (suspicious login / temporary lock). We can\u2019t fetch data until it\u2019s verified.": "Instagram biztons\u00e1gi ellen\u0151rz\u00e9st ig\u00e9nyel a fi\u00f3kj\u00e1hoz (gyan\u00fas bejelentkez\u00e9s / ideiglenes z\u00e1rol\u00e1s). Nem tudjuk lek\u00e9rni az adatokat az ellen\u0151rz\u00e9sig.",
    "Instagram returned an error.": "Instagram hib\u00e1t adott vissza.\nAz ",
