    "Instagram returned no data.": "Instagram nem adott vissza adatokat.",
    "Instagram session is invalid or pending verification.": "Instagram-munkamenet \u00e9rv\u00e9nytelen, vagy ellen\u0151rz\u00e9sre v\u00e1r.",
    "Instagram temporarily restricted this action. Please wait a bit and try again.": "Instagram ideiglenesen korl\u00e1tozta ezt a m\u0171veletet. K\u00e9rj\u00fck, v\u00e1rjon egy kicsit, \u00e9s pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra.\nAz ",
    "Instagram temporarily restricted this action. This can happen when requests are too frequent or activity looks automated. We stopped fetching data.": "Instagram ideiglenesen korl\u00e1tozta ezt a m\u0171veletet. Ez akkor fordulhat el\u0151, ha a k\u00e9r\u00e9sek t\u00fal gyakoriak, vagy a tev\u00e9kenys\u00e9g automatiz\u00e1ltnak t\u0171nik. Le\u00e1ll\u00edtottuk az adatok lek\u00e9r\u00e9s\u00e9t.",
    "Instagram Temporary Restriction": "Instagram ideiglenes korl\u00e1toz\u00e1s",
