    "Session verified, redirecting...": "Munkamenet ellen\u0151rizve, \u00e1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s...",
    "Sharks are older than Saturn\u2019s rings\u2014they were around millions of years before Saturn got its famous bling.": "A c\u00e1p\u00e1k id\u0151sebbek, mint a Szaturnusz gy\u0171r\u0171i \u2013 k\u00f6r\u00fclbel\u00fcl t\u00f6bb milli\u00f3 \u00e9vvel azel\u0151tt, hogy a Szaturnusz megkapta h\u00edres blingj\u00e9t.",
    "Sharks are older than trees\u2014sharks have been around for about 400 million years, trees for about 350 million.": "A c\u00e1p\u00e1k id\u0151sebbek a f\u00e1kn\u00e1l \u2013 a c\u00e1p\u00e1k k\u00f6r\u00fclbel\u00fcl 400 milli\u00f3 \u00e9ve, a f\u00e1k k\u00f6r\u00fclbel\u00fcl 350 milli\u00f3 \u00e9ve l\u00e9teznek.",
    "Show error: \${err.message}": "Hiba megjelen\u00edt\u00e9se: \${err.message}",
    "Sloths can hold their breath underwater longer than dolphins\u2014up to about 40 minutes.": "A lajh\u00e1rok tov\u00e1bb tudj\u00e1k tartani a l\u00e9legzet\u00fcket a v\u00edz alatt, mint a delfinek \u2013 ak\u00e1r 40 percig.",
    "Squirrels help grow thousands of new trees each year because they forget where they buried nuts.": "A m\u00f3kusok \u00e9vente t\u00f6bb ezer \u00faj f\u00e1t n\u00f6vesztenek, mert elfelejtik, hol temett\u00e9k el a di\u00f3t.",
    "Starting purchase...": "V\u00e1s\u00e1rl\u00e1s megkezd\u00e9se...",
    "Store": "Store",
    "Store link not set.": "Az \u00e1ruh\u00e1z linkje nincs be\u00e1ll\u00edtva.",
    "The Eiffel Tower can grow by about 15 centimeters in summer due to thermal expansion.": "Az Eiffel-torony ny\u00e1ron k\u00f6r\u00fclbel\u00fcl 15 centim\u00e9tert n\u0151het a h\u0151t\u00e1gul\u00e1s miatt.",
    "The first video game played in space was Tetris\u2014played on a Game Boy by a cosmonaut in 1993.": "Az els\u0151 \u0171rben j\u00e1tszott videoj\u00e1t\u00e9k a Tetris volt, amelyet egy \u0171rhaj\u00f3s Game Boy-on j\u00e1tszott 1993-ban.",
    "The lighter was invented before the match\u2014sometimes \u201cold\u201d tech is older than we think.": "Az \u00f6ngy\u00fajt\u00f3t a meccs el\u0151tt tal\u00e1lt\u00e1k fel \u2013 a \u201er\u00e9gi\u201d technol\u00f3gia n\u00e9ha r\u00e9gebbi, mint gondoln\u00e1nk.",
    "The total weight of all humans on Earth is roughly comparable to the total weight of all ants.": "A F\u00f6ld\u00f6n \u00e9l\u0151 \u00f6sszes ember \u00f6sszt\u00f6mege nagyj\u00e1b\u00f3l \u00f6sszem\u00e9rhet\u0151 az \u00f6sszes hangya \u00f6sszt\u00f6meg\u00e9vel.",
    "The world\u2019s first computer virus was called \u201cCreeper,\u201d and it displayed: \u201cI\u2019m the creeper, catch me if you can!\u201d": "A vil\u00e1g els\u0151 sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9pes v\u00edrus\u00e1t \u201eCreeper\u201d-nek h\u00edvt\u00e1k, \u00e9s ez \u00e1llt rajta: \u201e\u00c9n vagyok a k\u00fasz\u00f3n\u00f6v\u00e9ny, kapj el, ha tudsz!\u201d",
    "Time to update data! Analyze now to see changes in your follower list.": "Ideje friss\u00edteni az adatokat! Elemezze most, hogy l\u00e1ssa a v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1sokat a k\u00f6vet\u0151i list\u00e1j\u00e1n.",
    "Timeout": "Id\u0151t\u00fall\u00e9p\u00e9s",
    "Too many requests were sent.": "T\u00fal sok k\u00e9r\u00e9st k\u00fcldtek.",
    "User": "Felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3",
    "William Shakespeare is credited with the first recorded use of the word \u201cswagger\u201d\u2014even in the 16th century, he had style.": "William Shakespeare nev\u00e9hez f\u0171z\u0151dik a \u201eswagger\u201d sz\u00f3 els\u0151 feljegyzett haszn\u00e1lata \u2013 m\u00e9g a 16. sz\u00e1zadban is volt st\u00edlusa.",
    "Wombat poop is cube-shaped, so it doesn\u2019t roll away and can mark territory more effectively.": "Wombat kaki kocka alak\u00fa, \u00edgy nem gurul el, \u00e9s hat\u00e9konyabban jel\u00f6lheti ki a ter\u00fcleteket.",
    "Woodpeckers wrap their tongues around their brains to help avoid concussions\u2014using your tongue as a helmet is a wild solution.": "A fakop\u00e1ncsok az agyuk k\u00f6r\u00e9 csavarj\u00e1k nyelv\u00fcket, hogy elker\u00fclj\u00e9k az agyr\u00e1zk\u00f3d\u00e1st \u2013 a nyelv sisakk\u00e9nt val\u00f3 haszn\u00e1lata vad megold\u00e1s.",
    "Write Test": "\u00cdr\u00e1si teszt",
    "You can\u2019t really cry in space: without gravity, tears don\u2019t run down your face\u2014they form a blob in your eye.": "Nem igaz\u00e1n lehet s\u00edrni az \u0171rben: gravit\u00e1ci\u00f3 n\u00e9lk\u00fcl a k\u00f6nnyek nem csorognak le az arcodon \u2013 foltot k\u00e9peznek a szemedben.",
