    "Instagram message": "Wiadomo\u015b\u0107 na Instagramie",
    "Load error": "B\u0142\u0105d \u0142adowania",
    "Open Instagram": "Otw\u00f3rz Instagram",
    "Show error": "Poka\u017c b\u0142\u0105d",
    "SYSTEM UNDER MAINTENANCE": "SYSTEM W KONSERWACJI",
    "user": "u\u017cytkownik",
    "\u201cWhistling\u201d mice are essentially singing to each other, but at frequencies too high for humans to hear.": "\u201eGwi\u017cd\u017c\u0105ce\u201d myszy zasadniczo \u015bpiewaj\u0105 mi\u0119dzy sob\u0105, ale na cz\u0119stotliwo\u015bciach zbyt wysokich, aby ludzie mogli je us\u0142ysze\u0107.",
    "A blue whale\u2019s heart is so large that a human could swim through its main arteries.": "Serce p\u0142etwala b\u0142\u0119kitnego jest tak du\u017ce, \u017ce cz\u0142owiek m\u00f3g\u0142by przep\u0142yn\u0105\u0107 przez jego g\u0142\u00f3wne t\u0119tnice.",
    "A new update is available. Please check the store.": "Dost\u0119pna jest nowa aktualizacja. Prosz\u0119 sprawdzi\u0107 sklep.",
    "A snail can sleep for up to three years without waking up\u2014honestly, relatable.": "\u015alimak mo\u017ce spa\u0107 nawet przez trzy lata, nie budz\u0105c si\u0119 \u2013 szczerze m\u00f3wi\u0105c, mo\u017cna go por\u00f3wna\u0107.",
    "Access is restricted for this account.": "Dost\u0119p do tego konta jest ograniczony.",
    "Ad could not be shown. Please try again.": "Nie mo\u017cna wy\u015bwietli\u0107 reklamy. Spr\u00f3buj ponownie.",
    "Ad could not be shown. Results cannot be displayed.": "Nie mo\u017cna wy\u015bwietli\u0107 reklamy. Nie mo\u017cna wy\u015bwietli\u0107 wynik\u00f3w.",
    "An ant can lift up to 50 times its own weight\u2014if you were an ant, you could lift a car by yourself.": "Mr\u00f3wka mo\u017ce unie\u015b\u0107 ci\u0119\u017car do 50-krotno\u015bci w\u0142asnej wagi \u2014 gdyby\u015b by\u0142 mr\u00f3wk\u0105, m\u00f3g\u0142by\u015b samodzielnie podnie\u015b\u0107 samoch\u00f3d.",
    "An average cloud can weigh around 500,000 kg\u2014like a massive herd of elephants floating overhead.": "Przeci\u0119tna chmura mo\u017ce wa\u017cy\u0107 oko\u0142o 500 000 kg \u2014 jak ogromne stado s\u0142oni unosz\u0105ce si\u0119 nad g\u0142ow\u0105.",
    "An ostrich\u2019s eyes are bigger than its brain\u2014living on the fine line between looking and thinking.": "Oczy strusia s\u0105 wi\u0119ksze ni\u017c jego m\u00f3zg \u2013 \u017cyj\u0105 na cienkiej granicy mi\u0119dzy patrzeniem a my\u015bleniem.",
    "An unexpected error occurred.": "Wyst\u0105pi\u0142 nieoczekiwany b\u0142\u0105d.",
    "Analysis Time!": "Czas analizy!",
    "Ants don\u2019t have lungs\u2014and they never truly \u201csleep\u201d; they operate nonstop like tiny workaholics.": "Mr\u00f3wki nie maj\u0105 p\u0142uc \u2014 i tak naprawd\u0119 nigdy nie \u201e\u015bpi\u0105\u201d; dzia\u0142aj\u0105 bez przerwy jak mali pracoholicy.",
    "Auth Probe": "Sonda uwierzytelniaj\u0105ca",
    "Bananas are botanically berries, but strawberries aren\u2019t\u2014botany can be weird.": "Banany to jagody z botanicznego punktu widzenia, ale truskawki nie \u2013 botanika mo\u017ce by\u0107 dziwna.",
    "Butterflies taste with their feet\u2014when they land on a leaf, they\u2019re basically sampling dinner.": "Motyle smakuj\u0105 stopami \u2014 kiedy l\u0105duj\u0105 na li\u015bciu, w zasadzie pr\u00f3buj\u0105 obiadu.",
    "Cashews grow outside the cashew apple, hanging at the very end\u2014an oddly surprising design.": "Orzechy nerkowca wyrastaj\u0105 poza jab\u0142kiem nerkowca, zwisaj\u0105c na samym ko\u0144cu \u2013 dziwnie zaskakuj\u0105cy projekt.",
    "Cats spend about 70% of their lives asleep\u2014so a 10-year-old cat has been awake for only about 3 years.": "Koty sp\u0119dzaj\u0105 oko\u0142o 70% swojego \u017cycia we \u015bnie, wi\u0119c 10-letni kot nie \u015bpi zaledwie od oko\u0142o 3 lat.",
    "Clear Firebase logs": "Wyczy\u015b\u0107 dzienniki Firebase",
